# Kipuka EST — OTP Generation
Output docs/gifs/04-est-otp-generate.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# Generate One-Time Password — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab est-otp-generate factory-sensor-001 -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 4s
